Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] Add a third title row between New Game and Continue

Keep original sprites, cursor and vanilla choices; draw the port label
with the resident game font. Select remains a shortcut without shoulders.

--- a/src/menus/title/menu.c
